WEBVTT

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:33.940
It's getting colder every day.

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:36.800
Has anyone out there gotten sick yet?

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:43.640
What's the matter, Lee?

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.450
I think...

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:48.480
I'm getting a cold.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.750
That's weird. You seemed 
fine yesterday.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.750
Didn't you eat two bowls of ramen,

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:58.150
a plate of fried rice, 
and grilled liver yesterday?

00:01:58.150 --> 00:01:59.280
I, uh...

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:01.800
Then you took a nap and did a
thousand sit-ups after you woke up.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.440
You see...

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:09.480
Last night I was training by eating
ice cream naked under a waterfall.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.520
Why would you do that 
at this time of year?!

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:17.320
It's probably because I peed 
on a worm on the way home...

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.950
Worms have no effect 
on training or health!

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:24.350
Regardless, my cold is 
only getting worse!

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:28.230
I need to lie down in a warm,
sterile doctor's office and rest up!

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:28.980
Well...

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:30.670
I suppose...

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:40.680
<b>Sakura's My Nurse!</b>

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:45.640
I apologize for taking time 
away from your training.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:48.560
But I should be fine now.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.760
Tenten, please, go back 
and keep practicing.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:51.920
Don't worry about it!

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.270
I came all this way. 
I'd be happy to stay with you.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.490
No! Training time is 
much too valuable,

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.350
I couldn't bear to impinge on it!

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:03.330
Is there some reason you 
don't want me to be here?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.280
Oh no.

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:06.920
Of course not.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.000
Then what's the big deal?

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:12.240
I'll go get you checked 
in, be right back!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.170
<b>Exam Room</b>

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:15.170
Next patient!

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.630
Oh, Lee and Tenten!

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.920
Sakura? What're you doing here?

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.490
Lady Tsunade's out today,

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:25.140
so I'm working as the nurse 
on duty in her place.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:26.540
Oh?

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.390
<i>Sakura!</i>

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.400
<i>What's wrong, Lee?</i>

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:31.490
Well...

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:36.700
As you can see, I've caught a bad cold.

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:40.820
I see... You, too, huh?

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.120
Too?

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:45.710
Naruto?

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.470
Hey, Bushy-Brows.

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:56.340
Bushy-Brows, are you faking
just to hang out with Sakura?

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:59.070
Naruto, how could you even say that?

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.550
I would never!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:06.700
Are you suggesting that I sat naked
under a waterfall eating ice cream,

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:11.070
and went out of my way to 
pee on a night crawler?

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:15.230
And when I woke up the next day
still feeling perfectly healthy,

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.460
was left with no choice...

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.810
...but to skip out on training 
and fake being sick in...

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:21.580
...a last-ditch effort to 
have Sakura care for me?

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.350
Is that what you're saying?

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.030
You totally just confessed.

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:28.350
Oops!

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.320
Great minds think alike.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.710
So you're faking, too?

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:35.290
Maybe.

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.040
What're you two chatting about?

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.120
Nothing!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:46.120
Tenten, shouldn't you get 
back to your training?

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.470
Am I getting in the way here?

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.430
O-Of course not!

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.580
<i>We're in trouble, Naruto.</i>

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:56.980
<i>I think Tenten suspects 
we're not really sick.</i>

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:59.150
<i>If the truth comes out, we're toast.</i>

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.150
We have to keep up the act!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:04.860
No matter what it takes!

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:07.130
Let's see if you've got fevers.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:08.570
Time to take your temperature!

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.500
Temperature?

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.080
<b>Faker's Highway Checkpoint</b>

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.080
We will now take your temperature!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.790
Those with normal temps will 
be taken for questioning!

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:20.730
Here it comes, the first 
checkpoint on "Faker's Highway."

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:22.500
Body temperature!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.220
Many who attempt to travel down
Faker's Highway meet their end here.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.170
36.2?

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:31.770
You simpleton!

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.680
None with a normal 
temperature may pass!

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:39.010
One needs to be at least at 37 degrees...

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:41.480
...before they may even
glimpse the promised land!

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:47.450
We can't let our ruse be exposed yet!

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:51.810
Ninja Art, Thermometer Friction Fire!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:54.410
We've all done this 
at least once, right?

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:56.330
All done!

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:59.600
37.8...

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:01.540
Yep, you're a little feverish.

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.560
You're next, Lee.

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:07.570
<i>Did you see my amazing ninja 
technique, Bushy-Brows?</i>

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.630
What've you got?

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:12.660
I won't give up that easily!

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:22.460
Nice, Bushy-Brows!

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:25.160
You raised your temperature 
with pure burning passion!

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:28.650
A fever like that is much 
more than a common cold!

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.620
Hey, guys, how you feeling?

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:36.580
We're here for a visit.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.480
This melon looks delicious!

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.290
You shouldn't have!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.170
I didn't want to, it was 
pretty troublesome.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.260
But Choji wouldn't take 
no for an answer.

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:47.260
I thought we'd all split it.

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:49.420
Don't mind if I do!

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:50.590
What's this?

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.590
Hm, you guys are looking 
pretty healthy to me.

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:56.930
Oh, you've definitely 
got an appetite, too!

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.450
Crap.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:04.820
Factitious Labyrinth, a maze many
heroes have entered, never to return.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:09.030
Within lies a trap of epic 
proportions, the Friendly Visit!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.910
When you reach for the yummy melon...

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:16.370
If you're that eager to eat 
you've gotta be faking!

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:21.390
How troublesome!

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:24.340
If our illusion is revealed, 
it's game over!

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:29.200
<i>Shikamaru's a genius 
with an IQ of 200.</i>

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.120
<i>Flimsy lies won't work on him!</i>

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:34.130
<i>We'll just have to endure.</i>

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.760
<i>But then...</i>

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:38.750
Ah, if you're not hungry, 
we'll just have to eat it.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.950
Don't wanna let that baby go to waste.

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:43.980
<i>...Choji will eat the whole thing!</i>

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.410
Well, uh...

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:48.050
I want a piece.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.140
Bushy-Brows?

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.360
Stop! It's too dangerous!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:54.070
Oh, so you do have an appetite?

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:56.500
Not really, no.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:59.830
But I want to get over this 
cold as soon as possible,

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:04.040
so I need to get proper nourishment!

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.090
You do?!

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:09.300
Now, give me the melon!

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:14.410
My melon...

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:16.260
Oh, stop crying.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.990
Yup, gotta stay nourished,

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.510
even when you don't wanna eat!

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:22.640
Indeed.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.210
I have zero appetite,

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:27.750
but the body needs 
nutrients to heal itself!

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.640
Is it just my imagination,

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:32.120
or do they both seem just fine?

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:36.740
Actually, there's something 
I want to confirm, too.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:40.910
I think we're in the clear, Naruto.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.080
Yeah!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.700
Now we just need to wait and let
Sakura wait on us hand and foot.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:47.380
How're you two doing?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.090
All better?

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:53.610
We're in no condition to 
be out and about yet.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:58.350
We need Sakura to nurse 
us back to health.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.000
Oh?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.960
Well, if you want to get better,

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:04.020
you need your shots.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.110
Sh-Shots?!

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:10.770
It won't hurt... much.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.090
Wh-Wh-Wh-What do we do?!

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:18.580
The jig is up, we gotta confess!

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:20.490
Please stay calm, Naruto.

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.520
If we back down now,

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.830
all our hard work will have been in vain!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.930
But we're up against needles!

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:27.960
I know.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:31.170
But even when facing a needle,

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:34.560
if we don't stick out, we won't get stuck.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.430
What'd you say?

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:41.350
Who knows the answer?

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.970
Me! Me!

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:48.530
<i>Man, I have no idea.</i>

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:51.530
<i>But if I don't raise my hand,
I'll stick out and she'll pick me.</i>

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.080
<i>And if I do raise it she 
could pick me anyway―</i>

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:53.980
<i>Bushy-Brows?</i>

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:56.350
<i>Whoa!</i>

00:09:56.350 --> 00:10:00.130
<i>He's got his hand at just the right height.
I can't tell if he's raising it or not!</i>

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:02.580
<i>There's no way she'll pick him.</i>

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:07.040
<i>If we don't stick out, we won't get stuck.</i>

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.500
<i>Brilliant. I'm in.</i>

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:11.840
How about Hinata?

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.580
<i>Yes!</i>

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:18.180
I see, if we don't get picked...

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.990
...we don't get sticked!

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:21.400
Makes sense.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.010
Good plan.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.980
Like that would ever work!

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:36.600
Faking sick properly is 
a difficult challenge.

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:39.200
Kids, be good and don't imitate these two!

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:52.280
Everyone's seen a display 
like this before, right?

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.840
Yes, these are campaign posters!

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:59.070
Looks like the Hidden Leaf's 
having an election, too.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:05.430
Voting for the Leaf Village Popularity
Contest takes place tomorrow!

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:05.430
Leaf Village Popularity Contest

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:11.100
Our network took a poll of likely voters
to see where everyone currently stands.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.110
<b><i>Pre-Vote Data</i></b>

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.110
<b>Popularity</b>

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.110
<b>Likability</b>

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.110
We asked 1000 random people.

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:11.730
<b>More than my partner</b>

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:11.980
<b>More than my partner
Friend</b>

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:12.100
<b>More than my partner
Friend
Cousin</b>

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:12.190
<b>More than my partner
Friend
Cousin
Friend of a friend</b>

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:12.230
<b>More than my partner
Friend
Cousin
Friend of a friend
Meh</b>

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.100
<b>More than my partner
Friend
Cousin
Friend of a friend
Meh
Who cares</b>

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:16.780
In first place, with a commanding lead
over the second-place candidate...

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:24.370
<b>Sasuke Uchiha</b>

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:24.370
<b>956 votes</b>

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:18.480
Mr. Sasuke!

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:23.190
There's no doubt he'll place high 
in the actual voting tomorrow.

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:24.370
What the heck?!

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.860
I'm the main character, 
and Sasuke's been...

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:29.870
...shown like two times! 
Why is he in first place?!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:34.380
Well, I guess it's because 
he's just that cool?

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:38.380
Fine, what place did I come in?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.180
<b>Didn't rank</b>

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.180
You didn't rank.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.420
I-I...

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:48.420
I didn't rank?!

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.900
<b>One Vote for Rock Lee!</b>

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:01.610
<b>All-Night Debate</b>

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.560
I call to order the traditional meeting...

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:08.270
...of experts on the night
before voting day.

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:12.410
Sasuke Uchiha placing 
first is a problem, no?

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:17.620
Sasuke hasn't been a resident of
our village for some time now!

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:20.380
This is a popularity contest.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:23.510
There's no rule stating the 
candidates have to live here.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.470
What about the rumors 
Orochimaru is running?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:30.430
Rock Lee didn't even rank. 
That's a huge issue!

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:33.730
I can't believe the main 
character's this unpopular...

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:38.400
<b>Rock 
Lee</b>

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:38.400
I will surpass any genius 
through hard work! 
It's time to train!

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:38.400
Perhaps it's time we 
considered replacing him.

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:40.690
I concur.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:43.110
That's too rash.

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:46.510
He doesn't take his position 
seriously enough!

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:48.250
No, no―

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:51.790
This is awful.

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:54.640
At this rate, I'll lose my job!

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:57.250
I agree that not even 
ranking is a bad sign.

00:12:57.590 --> 00:13:01.210
How long a show lasts is tied directly
to the main character's popularity.

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:04.910
Why am I so unpopular?

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:07.030
Wait...

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:10.600
Does my campaign poster look stupid?

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.740
What is this monstrosity?!

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.060
They couldn't take a better picture?

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.240
The flashes were so bright

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:19.190
I couldn't help but 
squint the whole time.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.090
This was the best one they got.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:23.500
You should've kept them shut.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.160
Hey, Tenten, your picture...

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:29.840
...looks a lot prettier than in real life.

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:31.840
Now that you mention it...

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:34.000
Was this picture...

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.730
...shopped?

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:39.950
Wh-What if it was?

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:43.640
I'm a girl. I'm allowed a few 
digital enhancements, aren't I?

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:46.240
It's not like I'm completely 
unrecognizable...

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:47.790
A few?

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:49.720
Oh shut up, leave me alone!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:54.000
They made your Leaf symbols 
bigger, that must be it.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.060
They didn't edit that!

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:59.600
And your hair buns are smaller, too.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.570
That's not it either!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:06.860
Tenten, are you aiming for first
place so you can take my job?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.980
No, of course not―

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:10.240
Ding ding ding!

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:12.830
Naruto!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:17.040
Every character wants the lead role!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.800
No... You, too, Naruto?

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:24.310
Wait, are you in danger of losing
the lead role in the main series?

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:26.390
Kakashi Sensei's really popular nowadays.

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:27.470
Itachi, too.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:29.440
Don't say any more!

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:32.930
I'm here to take over this show, too!

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.360
Keep the seat warm for 
me until tomorrow!

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:41.150
I have to come up with a 
way to win this contest!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:45.190
<b>{please fill}</b>

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:45.190
And the next morning, voting began.

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:52.120
Naruto Uzumaki! Cast your 
votes for Naruto Uzumaki!

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:56.540
Very flashy. That's just like him.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.240
So that's his game, huh?

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.870
If Naruto's gonna be flashy,

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.090
I'll fight back by relating 
to the common man!

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.430
That'll be 530 yen.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:06.590
Um...

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:07.640
Huh?

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:10.510
Uh, just a second...

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:12.560
Can you hurry it up?

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:13.880
What's going on?

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:15.150
Sorry!

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:19.690
There it is. I have a coupon.

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:24.270
Sorry, that coupon expired yesterday.

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:29.890
That is a common occurrence, but it's
got nothing to do with the contest!

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:32.590
Then I'll compete on policy.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:33.620
Policy?

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:35.020
Yeah!

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:38.080
When I'm voted most popular character,

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:41.650
I'll increase ratings to 200%!

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:45.160
That's mathematically impossible!

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.460
I'll make the comic a bestseller,

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.540
and win the Akutagawa 
Award, the Naoki Award,

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:51.990
and the Nobel Prize!

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:54.260
Those are all for novels!

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.930
Comics don't qualify!

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.980
All DVDs of the show will be free!

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:00.930
That's definitely not happening.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:05.240
You're just making a bunch of 
promises you can't possible keep.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:08.910
I thought that's what everyone did.

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:12.780
If any actual politicians heard 
that, they'd be pretty miffed.

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.280
<b>Voting Update</b>

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:19.020
We're here in front of the
polling station with our first report.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:21.250
<b>Early Tally            Currently 5% of the vote is in.</b>

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:20.910
Wh-What's going on?

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.120
The picture shrank.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:32.260
<b>Early Tally</b>

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:27.450
We're using this ticker to report
the results as fast as possible.

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:32.260
So no matter what show is airing,
people can see who's winning, huh?

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:37.220
That's neat and all, but don't 
you think it's too cramped?

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:40.680
You're not supposed to be on that side!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.090
Candidate Lee is in a real pinch.

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:55.970
<b>Neji Hyuga</b>

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:46.870
We're getting an update!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.690
The results are in already?

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:51.570
W-Wow!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:55.160
We are predicting that Candidate
Neji Hyuga will take fourth place!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:55.990
That was fast!

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:59.740
<b>Hyuga Campaign HQ</b>

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:01.200
Fourth place... Sounds about right.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:05.890
How can they confirm all those votes
when the polls just opened?

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:07.670
Could it be possible...?

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.630
<b>Fire SP
The Mystery of the Early Voting Results!!</b>

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:11.500
Behold! The secret of 
the network's ability...

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:15.340
...to apparently predict the winners 
of elections is revealed!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.780
We're here to prove the rumors that the...

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.640
...TV station is in possession 
of a time machine!

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:25.340
Time machines don't exist!

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:27.830
And stop rifling through 
people's drawers!

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:30.360
Actually, they perform 
complicated analyses...

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:34.920
...of entry and exit polls, and―

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:35.740
I get it.

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:41.530
Basically, they round up the money
they get over the holidays,

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:43.880
and plan out what they can buy with it.

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:47.210
That's easy to understand,
but I think it's a little off...

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:51.830
Naruto's popularity is shooting way up!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:52.800
It is?!

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:57.510
You shaking in your 
boots yet, Bushy-Brows?

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:00.610
I'd expect nothing less from the 
main show's main character.

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.810
Yeah, same here.

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:06.490
Is this one of your fliers?

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:10.280
Bikini girls?

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.840
So this is the secret 
to your popularity!

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.800
Does that really sway anyone?

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:20.990
I'm sure there's a sizable demographic
who'll vote for stuff like this.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:21.870
However!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:26.180
You may win their votes,
but you won't win their hearts!

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:26.990
Lee...

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:28.120
Bushy-Brows...

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:34.630
I want to win supporters 
honestly, by being myself!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.750
Let's see what you've got, then!

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:43.380
You talked a big game. 
Do you have a plan?

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:44.720
You bet I do.

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:56.260
<b>Rock Lee!!</b>

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:56.260
<b>For a bright future!</b>

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:46.630
Look at this flyer!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:51.710
I got coupons for some of 
the major village shops.

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:54.730
The people will love me for this!

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:59.310
There's not an honest 
fiber in those coupons!

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:01.310
That flyer's totally against the rules!

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:02.700
Well said!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.450
You fool!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.580
Guy Sensei...

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:12.400
Lee, why did you become a ninja?

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:14.630
Have you forgotten?

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.090
A ninja lives in the shadows.

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:19.670
Even completely unseen,

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.160
his worth is measured by

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:23.350
his ability to complete the mission.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:27.310
Guy Sensei... I was wrong!

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:32.910
I'll never be a great ninja if I run around
worrying about popularity contests!

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:34.520
Lee!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.730
Guy Sensei!

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:41.650
And so, Lee forgot about the vote
and went back to training.

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.790
<b>Popularity Contest</b>

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.790
<b>Confirming the results!</b>

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.790
<b>#10 - #2</b>

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.790
But the contest continued.

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:54.630
We're here with somewhat bittersweet
news for places 3 through 10.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:59.550
Miss Katsuyu, anything to 
say about your placing 6th?

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:03.110
Why did I rank below a slug?!

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:07.430
We've just tallied the last 
votes for Candidate Rock Lee.

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:09.000
He ranks...

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:11.890
First! Incredible!

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:17.170
You did it, Lee!

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:18.500
Way to go!

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:26.330
<b>Congratulations #1!</b>

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:26.330
Why'd his popularity shoot up so much?

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:27.750
Why do you think?

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:32.890
The sight of Lee working so hard to
better himself moved the people.

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:36.000
Let's hear from the voters.

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:41.140
"Lee training in the background was impressive!"

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:42.170
<b>Scandal for General Election Candidate!</b>

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:42.170
<b>Akamaru caught urinating in public!</b>

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:45.540
"He looked really cool flitting 
in and out of the shot!"

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.680
"We heard similar things 
from many others."

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:51.770
So you were trying to 
be popular after all!

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:53.580
Nice job, Lee!

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:55.140
Thanks, Guy Sensei!

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:57.640
Breaking news.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:21:02.740
<b>Breaking Election News</b>

00:20:57.640 --> 00:21:01.150
Regarding the tally for Rock Lee...

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.410
It seems there was an error.

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.750
The correct results are now 
in, and first place...

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:11.660
Candidate Sasuke Uchiha!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.000
Sasuke wins the contest!

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:17.960
Um...

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.670
I was so low...

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:21.530
Rock Lee ranked...

00:21:21.890 --> 00:21:25.130
Er, he didn't rank.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:30.770
U-Unranked...

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:33.710
Another mystery of 
election predictions!

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:36.770
Sometimes, they mess up!

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:38.810
Kids, when you're old enough,

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:41.190
make sure you get out and vote!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.520
Should the moral be that serious?

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:25.410
Next week is "Might Guy - 
A Story of Love and Hair!"

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:27.840
<b>Might Guy - A Story of Love and Hair!
Substitute Narrator!</b>

00:23:25.410 --> 00:23:27.840
and "Substitute Narrator!"

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:29.970
The narrator's got a tough job.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:32.330
You've gotta be able to recite 
your lines quickly and smoothly.

00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:34.570
I've been doing practice exercises!

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:35.980
Peter Piper peck―

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:37.260
Peeper―

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:38.680
You're hopeless.

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:43.020
Peter Piper picked a peck 
of pickled peppers!

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:46.670
Wow, Neji's way better 
at this than you!
